1
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:12,930
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:16,030
[Episode 15]

3
00:01:19,430 --> 00:01:20,230
Ji.

4
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,039
Are you okay?

5
00:01:22,039 --> 00:01:22,570
I'm fine.

6
00:01:22,950 --> 00:01:23,590
Thank goodness.

7
00:01:23,590 --> 00:01:25,590
Hope we captured something useful.

8
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:26,900
I'll go back and check.

9
00:01:28,150 --> 00:01:29,270
Thank you, Ji.

10
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:30,560
It's nothing.

11
00:01:30,710 --> 00:01:33,039
As long as it helps you
and the other girls.

12
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:34,500
I really think

13
00:01:34,759 --> 00:01:36,690
I'd make a great undercover agent.

14
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:39,430
What do we do next?

15
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:53,590
Hello, Mr. Zhao.

16
00:01:54,590 --> 00:01:55,840
Do you have time now?

17
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:05,700
Where is Lin Di'er?

18
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:08,410
I thought this was a fake‑divorce act.

19
00:02:09,190 --> 00:02:11,250
No need to put on such a show, is there?

20
00:02:12,030 --> 00:02:13,450
She really went abroad.

21
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,740
Did your daughter go with her?

22
00:02:17,430 --> 00:02:19,290
She was sent to my mother's place.

23
00:02:26,079 --> 00:02:27,520
What a mansion.

24
00:02:28,470 --> 00:02:30,930
Your property fees must be
through the roof.

25
00:02:36,910 --> 00:02:37,710
What?

26
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:42,050
Are you auditing
my household expenses now?

27
00:02:44,030 --> 00:02:46,430
Do you want to be the mistress
of this house?

28
00:02:48,190 --> 00:02:50,850
I have no desire
to repeat Lin Di'er's mistakes.

29
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:54,090
Being with you comes with
far too many strings attached.

30
00:02:55,150 --> 00:02:56,600
I suppose

31
00:02:56,870 --> 00:02:57,960
Ms. Lin is living

32
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,470
her own life now.

33
00:03:00,380 --> 00:03:01,310
Did you come here

34
00:03:02,190 --> 00:03:03,590
just to mock me?

35
00:03:07,590 --> 00:03:09,000
I came to tell you—

36
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:12,280
now that you've broken free
from Lin Di'er's control,

37
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:14,360
shouldn't you be more honest with me?

38
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:16,329
What do you mean?

39
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,750
You own Spotlight.

40
00:03:21,329 --> 00:03:22,400
If I hadn't asked,

41
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:24,060
when were you going to tell me?

42
00:03:24,310 --> 00:03:25,550
You investigated me?

43
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,980
Did I need to investigate?

44
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:32,240
All that information is
publicly available online.

45
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:34,560
Besides, I'm your acting agent now.

46
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:37,710
I have to be the one who knows you best.

47
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,590
Zhao Fang runs the bar.

48
00:03:49,470 --> 00:03:50,520
I funded it.

49
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,470
But do you know what he's been

50
00:03:52,470 --> 00:03:53,200
doing there?

51
00:03:53,910 --> 00:03:56,040
I can't interfere in his private life.

52
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,030
What if it affects you?

53
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:03,020
I don't want to see
your old scandals resurface.

54
00:04:08,590 --> 00:04:09,750
You care about me?

55
00:04:13,310 --> 00:04:14,310
Don't worry.

56
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,140
He can't affect me.

57
00:04:19,310 --> 00:04:20,440
A verbal guarantee?

58
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,360
I don't buy it.

59
00:04:23,270 --> 00:04:24,930
How am I supposed to trust you?

60
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,870
If he causes trouble again,

61
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:32,940
at worst,

62
00:04:33,530 --> 00:04:35,159
I'll cut all ties with him.

63
00:04:39,190 --> 00:04:40,070
True.

64
00:04:40,310 --> 00:04:43,720
Mr. Zhao, you only care about interests,

65
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:46,360
not feelings.

66
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:56,120
Do you think I treat you the same way?

67
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:01,270
Our current working partnership

68
00:05:01,270 --> 00:05:02,480
is enough for me.

69
00:05:03,390 --> 00:05:04,590
As for anything more,

70
00:05:05,630 --> 00:05:07,090
that isn't mine to decide.

71
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,530
All right.

72
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,270
Whatever you say,

73
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:13,920
goes.

74
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,480
Mr. Zhao.

75
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,320
Please behave yourself.

76
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:23,840
You pushed me into divorcing Lin Di'er.

77
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,800
I know exactly

78
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,830
what you want.

79
00:05:29,070 --> 00:05:30,340
And I'll give it to you.

80
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,120
Zhao Xiao! Zhao Xiao!

81
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:35,200
Let go of me! Let go!

82
00:05:35,220 --> 00:05:37,530
Are you crazy?
We're only business partners!

83
00:05:37,530 --> 00:05:38,210
Zhao Xiao!

84
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,170
Let me go!

85
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,370
Let me go!

86
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,800
Sorry, I overstepped again.

87
00:06:00,390 --> 00:06:01,040
I just...

88
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:01,990
I know.

89
00:06:09,930 --> 00:06:11,890
If this puts pressure on you,

90
00:06:16,870 --> 00:06:18,570
I won't do it again.

91
00:06:47,270 --> 00:06:48,040
Drive.

92
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,830
Cui Peng is actually Ms. Qin's husband.

93
00:06:57,860 --> 00:07:00,240
[SHOCKING: Business Queen Qin Wen's
Secret Marriage Exposed]

94
00:07:00,260 --> 00:07:02,490
[Freeloader Cui Peng's Background Exposed:
Living Off His Wife's Resources]

95
00:07:14,190 --> 00:07:14,920
Hello?

96
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,000
Ms. Du,

97
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,560
I want to ask you a question.

98
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:22,240
Are Cui Peng and Ms. Qin,
the owner of Xingyue Company,

99
00:07:23,390 --> 00:07:25,520
in some kind of special relationship?

100
00:07:25,870 --> 00:07:28,870
Someone like Cui Peng,
with no connections or resources,

101
00:07:28,870 --> 00:07:30,290
definitely needs someone

102
00:07:30,290 --> 00:07:32,190
to pull strings behind the scenes.

103
00:07:32,190 --> 00:07:33,320
But let me tell you,

104
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:36,000
I've known Ms. Qin for years.

105
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,070
I've never seen

106
00:07:37,070 --> 00:07:39,040
her care so deeply for anyone.

107
00:07:39,270 --> 00:07:40,190
I don't know what it is about Cui Peng

108
00:07:40,190 --> 00:07:41,650
that attracts her so much.

109
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:43,960
Is one older man really worth all this?

110
00:07:45,310 --> 00:07:46,510
What's even funnier—

111
00:07:46,830 --> 00:07:47,750
Ms. Qin once

112
00:07:47,750 --> 00:07:50,790
was heartbroken because Cui Peng wanted
to break up with her.

113
00:07:50,790 --> 00:07:52,360
She showed up at my place late one night

114
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:54,290
and cried the whole night through.

115
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:55,510
So,

116
00:07:55,510 --> 00:07:57,750
a woman should never be a simp.

117
00:07:57,870 --> 00:07:58,600
Simping

118
00:07:58,600 --> 00:08:00,160
happens regardless of status,
age or position.

119
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,090
I'm telling you.

120
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:01,870
Got it.

121
00:08:05,870 --> 00:08:07,310
Thank you, Ms. Du.

122
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,160
You've helped me out again.

123
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:11,300
Xu Jing, you have to know:

124
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:15,090
there are no secrets
in the entertainment industry.

125
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:17,720
So there's no such thing as a leak.

126
00:08:18,070 --> 00:08:19,800
Everyone knows a lot of things.

127
00:08:20,070 --> 00:08:21,510
They just choose not to talk about it,

128
00:08:21,510 --> 00:08:23,170
because it serves no purpose.

129
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:24,560
Ms. Du,

130
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:28,560
I have one more question for you.

131
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:31,060
Why are you willing to help me so much?

132
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:32,659
You finally asked.

133
00:08:33,510 --> 00:08:34,570
Not bad.

134
00:08:34,750 --> 00:08:36,669
Your emotional intelligence
isn't terrible.

135
00:08:36,669 --> 00:08:37,299
Xu Jing,

136
00:08:37,690 --> 00:08:39,860
I, Du Chunqing, am willing to help you.

137
00:08:40,390 --> 00:08:42,600
First, because you are talented.

138
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:45,360
Second, because you are smart enough.

139
00:08:45,750 --> 00:08:47,720
Third, when I was in trouble,

140
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:49,650
you helped me without hesitation.

141
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,440
If a woman wants to succeed,

142
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:54,040
she must have enough bargaining chips.

143
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,750
Now I am willing to give you a hand

144
00:08:55,750 --> 00:08:57,350
and be your bargaining chip.

145
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,600
Because back then,

146
00:09:01,510 --> 00:09:03,170
I went through the same thing.

147
00:09:16,750 --> 00:09:17,550
Xu.

148
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:18,960
Yes, Ms. Chen.

149
00:09:19,020 --> 00:09:20,040
Your Americano.

150
00:09:20,870 --> 00:09:22,000
Thank you, Ms. Chen.

151
00:09:22,190 --> 00:09:25,320
I hope you'll keep looking out
for Zhao Xiao.

152
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:28,750
There's no need for such formalities.

153
00:09:28,750 --> 00:09:30,960
I only got to know him

154
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,200
because you nurtured his career so well.

155
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,510
Don't flatter me.

156
00:09:34,150 --> 00:09:36,100
My abilities are limited.

157
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,510
Di'er's gone abroad,

158
00:09:37,750 --> 00:09:39,050
and the more work piles up,

159
00:09:39,050 --> 00:09:40,760
the more I overlook things.

160
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:44,460
Look at the Zhao Xiao
and Zhao Fang brothers—

161
00:09:44,750 --> 00:09:46,720
they've given you quite a headache.

162
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,960
You should treat yourself better.

163
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:48,760
Zhao Fang?

164
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:49,980
What about him?

165
00:09:51,030 --> 00:09:52,720
Don't you know about the Spotlight?

166
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:55,550
Zhao Fang isn't like Zhao Xiao.

167
00:09:55,550 --> 00:09:57,280
He doesn't have much ambition.

168
00:09:57,510 --> 00:09:59,360
Running a bar,

169
00:09:59,470 --> 00:10:00,870
doing a little business—

170
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,750
at least it gives him something to do.

171
00:10:02,750 --> 00:10:03,380
Yes.

172
00:10:03,870 --> 00:10:07,670
But business has to be either clean
or doomed to fail.

173
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:11,210
I'm afraid he'll drag Zhao Xiao down.

174
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:13,720
[My Basic Information]

175
00:10:30,390 --> 00:10:32,080
Hi, I'm here for the audition,

176
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:33,340
referred by Zhao Fang.

177
00:10:33,370 --> 00:10:34,340
Okay, come in.

178
00:10:55,030 --> 00:10:56,790
Answer it. Answer it.

179
00:11:04,860 --> 00:11:05,800
Which room?

180
00:11:06,780 --> 00:11:07,510
Hey girl.

181
00:11:07,530 --> 00:11:08,600
Don't come any closer!

182
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,260
Don't move!

183
00:11:10,010 --> 00:11:10,720
Calm down.

184
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,780
Put the knife down.

185
00:11:13,670 --> 00:11:14,940
You leave first.

186
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,700
Don't come closer!

187
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,510
Don't... Don't do anything reckless.

188
00:11:20,510 --> 00:11:22,970
We can talk things out.

189
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:24,660
You're all liars!

190
00:11:30,670 --> 00:11:31,670
Are you there yet?

191
00:11:33,510 --> 00:11:34,940
Handle it cleanly.

192
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,660
Don't cause trouble for your brother.
